    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86609" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπ-αντάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go forth to meet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.92
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				6.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
