				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἑῴας ἁπάσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					14.183b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>take steps in advance</i> or <i>in good time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
