			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>to be interposed, intervene,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ προαπαντῶντα σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					8.3
				</span></i>
			(pl.).</div>
